WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.000
[Starting next to new houses, looking over a wetland full of native grasses]

00:01:00.000 --> 00:02:00.000
[A white gravel path beside the street and the wetland]

00:02:00.000 --> 00:04:00.000
[A concrete path winding between tussock grasses, with houses on the hill behind]

00:04:00.000 --> 00:05:00.000
[Walking along the path with tall grasses on both sides]

00:05:00.000 --> 00:06:00.000
[Crossing a wooden bridge with green railings over the water]

00:06:00.000 --> 00:07:00.000
[Walking on the footpath next to the road, then back beside the wetland]

00:07:00.000 --> 00:09:00.000
[A concrete path and bridge, with a small stream running through the planting]

00:09:00.000 --> 00:11:00.000
[Passing a bus shelter, then looking out over flax and grasses]

00:11:00.000 --> 00:13:00.000
[Close up of the native plants growing around the water]

00:13:00.000 --> 00:15:11.000
[Open views of the wetland and new houses, finishing at a wooden deck with a fence]
